    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Maintenance Mode Lite is a lightweight plugin that allows you to:<br />\n&#8211; Display a custom maintenance page.<br />\n&#8211; Schedule maintenance mode start and end times.<br />\n&#8211; Show personalized messages for your visitors.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress.</li>\n<li>Configure the settings under <strong>Settings &gt; Maintenance Mode Lite</strong>.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='can%20i%20schedule%20maintenance%20mode%3F'>\nCan I schedule maintenance mode?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, you can set a start and end time for maintenance mode in the plugin settings.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='can%20i%20customize%20the%20maintenance%20message%3F'>\nCan I customize the maintenance message?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Absolutely! You can enter your custom message in the settings panel.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Compatibility with latest wordpress version v6.7.1.</li>\n<li>Compatibility with php version v8+.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Enables a customizable maintenance mode for your WordPress website.",
